.DS_Store
.venv/
__pycache__/
TOC.pdf

# Delivery PDFs ARE tracked, by the owner's decision on 2026-10-31. They are what the owner
# actually reads, and `_book/` is never served by GitHub Pages, so tracking them puts them in the
# repository without putting anything on the live site. The raw build output stays ignored in
# latex/.gitignore: `latex/book.pdf` is regenerated by every build, and the delivery copy beside
# this file is the artefact worth keeping. Each committed delivery adds its own megabytes for good,
# so commit a delivery, not a build.
